8,93,21],[32540,25.5,1976,49,91,21]],"links":[["Becker County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/minnesota/becker-county"],["ARC or PLC in Becker County","/arc-plc/minnesota/becker-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids in Becker County came in under 90% of normal in November to December 39 times since 1951, the most of any pair. In 2026 so far, April to May sat at 65% of normal on the middle of the grids. June to July is the wettest pair at 7.77 inches of normal, and January to February is the driest at 1.28. Grid 31936 had its driest year in 1976 at 41%.</p>"}
